<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct platinum imports down 28.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct platinum imports down 28.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's platinum imports in October were down 28.8 percent from a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Thursday showed.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			 Oct 96    Sept 96	 Oct 95</p>
<p> Total		 5.28	5.62	    7.42</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia		2.05	2.05	    2.60</p>
<p> South Africa	2.18	2.26	    3.23</p>
<p>Imports in the first 10 months of 1996 were 57.48 tonnes, against 60.22 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk (81-3 3432 7431)</p>
</text>
